 "titulo": "You built a rainwater cistern 🌧️ #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A CISTERN",
 "descripcion": "How a roof, a gutter and a buried tank keep a family in water through an 8-month dry season, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #water #cistern #brazil #shorts",
 "tags": [
